        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-18T08:36:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You understand it perfectly. SOmething to keep in mind though, while it seems gret to have your damage added 5 times, not so great when the Opposition does it. Flagships are, understandably,&nbsp;tough (see The Omega Singularity). In order to kill it, you will probably have to team up against it. This means that each of the Strike Force ships will be getting a full and complete pounding.</p>",
